# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Data is NEVER committed. Everything under data/ is ignored, including price
# histories pulled from yfinance and any cached policy-announcement scrapes.
# Reproducibility comes from src/policy_event_study/data/*.py +
# docs/data_inventory.md, not from checked-in bytes. Only .gitkeep files
# survive so the tree shape is preserved.
#
# ONE DELIBERATE EXCEPTION: data/events/. The event dictionary is hand-curated
# announcement dates, timestamps and provenance -- it is *source*, not data. No
# loader can regenerate it, and "which events were in the study, and when did
# that change" must be answerable from git history rather than from memory. It
# is therefore committed, and `make data-check` whitelists exactly these paths
# and nothing else under data/.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
data/**
!data/
!data/raw/
!data/interim/
!data/processed/
!data/**/.gitkeep
!data/events/
!data/events/uk_energy_policy_events.csv
!data/events/README.md
!data/events/candidates.md
# Chronology is the audit trail of deductive discovery: what the grid asked and
# which published source answered it. Committed so a pre-registration tag
# captures the discovery step, not just its output. The raw sweep CSVs stay
# ignored -- they are regenerable and large.
!data/events/chronology_*.md
!data/events/shortlist_*.md
!data/events/shortlist_final_*.md
!data/events/completeness_audit_*.md
!data/events/shortlist_manual.yaml
!data/events/inventory_apriori_*.yaml
!data/events/inventory_apriori_*.md
!data/events/date_resolutions_*.yaml
# Briefing text cache: regenerable from the Library, and large.
data/events/briefing_cache/
!data/exposure/
!data/exposure/firm_attributes.csv
!data/exposure/policy_targets.csv
!data/exposure/README.md
!data/universe/
!data/universe/uk_listed_universe.csv

# Secrets
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
secrets/

# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.eggs/
build/
dist/
.venv/
venv/
.python-version

# Tooling caches
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ipynb_checkpoints/
htmlcov/
.coverage
.coverage.*

# Notebooks
notebooks/**/*.html
notebooks/**/*.pdf

# Reports
reports/figures/
reports/tables/
!reports/.gitkeep

# OS / editor
.DS_Store
.idea/
.vscode/
